id: pm-slack-toolchain-1104
title: Migrate PR180 to the November 4 pm toolchain
description: "Update the exact toolchain and migrate genuine SDK fixtures for https://github.com/unbraind/pm-slack/pull/180. Preserve payload and destination native-state models and report distinct upstream regressions."
type: Chore
