acceptance_criteria: "Reproduce each failed file on SDK 2026.11.4; preserve literal model values and explicit empty relationships; full 100 percent coverage, typecheck and documented quality gates pass."
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-04T19:20:04.171Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Test: pm-cli 2026.10.30 GH-1614 keeps typed sentinel inputs literal. The payload file reproduces 5/7 passing on 2026.11.4; its model and empty-body producer fail on parent:none. The destination model fails at its first such create too. Migrate intended clears to unset, including conditional parent/assignee clears while preserving the seeded random-call order, exact operation counts, native-state models and payload assertions. No production Slack defect is established."
  "2026-11-04T19:24:08.614Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Production release tooling: pm-changelog 2026.10.31 change Fail closed when requested release notes have no matching section (#302) refuses already-tagged 2026.11.3 because no qualifying tracker notes exist. Full-history generation/check now opt into no-pending-release plus include-empty; existing empty tags get honest No changes sections. Fresh release notes and prepend remain strict. The script regression fails before this fix and passes 5/5 after it."
  "2026-11-04T19:34:10.987Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Final-source focused evidence: test/payload-compilation.test.ts passes all 7 tests including its 500-sequence real-SDK model (349.5 seconds). The repaired 500-sequence destination case passes 1/1 (187.1 seconds); the original destination diagnostics passed every other case. Linked SDK producer test passes. Typecheck, build:test, docstrings, production audit (0 vulnerabilities), pack dry-run, generated changelog, release-date and publish-attestation checks pass. Full coverage is queued; no new upstream defect established."
  "2026-11-04T19:39:57.006Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Secondary pin audit: tracked bun.lock still resolved the October 4 toolchain and older root declarations. Regenerate it with bun install --lockfile-only --ignore-scripts so CLI/ops resolve 2026.11.4 and changelog 2026.10.31, matching package.json and the npm lock. The two packed-host scripts also derive the current host from that declaration. Keep the supported minimum unchanged."
  "2026-11-04T20:38:41.551Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Release-tooling refinement: full generation/check retain pending windows for future prepared releases. Opt into include-empty for honest empty sections and remove blanket no-pending-release suppression. The script regression also forbids suppressing pending windows; fresh release-note/prepend commands remain strict. Final generation/check and date verification pass."
  "2026-11-04T21:17:42.112Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Final full gate PASS: nice -n 10 env NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null npm run coverage reports 1020 tests passed, 0 failed/cancelled/skipped; 100.00 percent lines, branches and functions across all 9 configured source files, with source-presence validation passing. The destination and payload 500-sequence native-SDK models both pass. Final release-script regression passes 5/5 and fails when only include-empty is removed. Typecheck, build/test compilation, docstrings, audit (0 vulnerabilities), pack dry-run, final changelog/date/attestation checks and strict tracker health passed. Tracked dist was rebuilt unchanged. The refreshed bun.lock validates frozen resolution at the requested pins. No new upstream defect established."
